[PTL] Add External Input parameters for NN Flex Initial Analog Settings

[Feature Description]
Support ability to adjust NN flex feature settings.
Allow overriding NN flex settings when FlexibleAnalogSettings is on.
Override knobs are organized in 3 groups - PHY / LP5 / DDR5.
Each group has a bitmask of override enables (LP5/DDR5 share the same
bitmask): NnFlexPhyOvrdMask and NnFlexDramOvrdMask.

